   "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><title>Regulation (EU) No 269/2014 (authored fixture text)</title></head>\n<body>\n<p class=\"oj-doc-ti\">COUNCIL REGULATION (EU) No 269/2014 (authored fixture text; not the published act)</p>\n<p class=\"oj-ti-art\">Article 2</p>\n<p class=\"oj-normal\">1. All funds and economic resources belonging to the natural or legal persons, entities or bodies listed in Annex I shall be frozen.</p>\n<p class=\"oj-doc-ti\">ANNEX I</p>\n<p class=\"oj-normal\">List of natural and legal persons, entities and bodies referred to in Article 2</p>\n<p class=\"oj-normal\">Examplar Freight LLC. Registration number 1027700000001. Fictional fixture entry.</p>\n<p class=\"oj-normal\">MV Fictional Star. IMO 9999991. Fictional fixture entry.</p>\n</body></html>\n",
